  "description": "Design a distributed rate limiter from a cookie-jar story to SDE-2 answers: token bucket, leaky bucket, fixed and sliding windows, Redis plus Lua atomicity, fail open vs closed, 429 headers, multi-region, and Envoy Gateway on Kubernetes.",
  "hero": {
